# License

This project combines code under multiple open-source licenses:

## GPL v2 (GNU General Public License v2)
- **prboom/** - PrBoom engine source code
- **prboom-esp32-compat/** - ESP32 platform layer and DOOM integration (except the Apache-licensed files listed below)
- **prboom-wad-tables/** - WAD data tables
- **prboom_main.c**, **main/** - ESP32-S3 entry point and stubs for this port
- All modifications and derivatives of the above

Covers the original DOOM source code released by id Software under GPL v2, and all subsequent derivative works (Boom, PrBoom, etc.), as well as the badge-specific code added by this project.

Full text: See `prboom/COPYING`

## Apache License 2.0
- **prboom-esp32-compat/spi_lcd.c** - SPI LCD driver (based on Espressif example code, adapted for the badge's ST7789 display)
- **prboom-esp32-compat/psxcontroller.c** - PSX controller driver (Espressif)

Copyright Espressif Systems (Shanghai) PTE LTD; see the license headers in the files.

Full text: http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

## Data Files
- **data/DOOM1.WAD** - Shareware DOOM episode 1 data. Distributable in unmodified form under id Software's shareware terms; it is not open source. DOOM is a registered trademark of id Software LLC.

